  "steps": [
    "Boil the pasta: cook 60g whole wheat pasta as per package instructions.",
    "Reserve 1 cup of the starchy pasta water before draining.",
    "Prepare the sauce base: blend 100g high-protein paneer with 100ml skim milk until smooth and creamy.",
    "Cook the sauce: in a pan, melt 1/2 tsp butter and add 1 tsp whole wheat flour.",
    "Stir continuously for 1-2 minutes until the flour is lightly toasted.",
    "Add the pasta water and the paneer-milk blend. Stir until well combined and smooth.",
    "Add veggies and flavor: toss in the chopped vegetables, basil, and garlic.",
    "Add all seasonings: black pepper, red chilli flakes, crunchy garlic, peri peri powder, oregano, and salt.",
    "Cook on medium heat until veggies are just tender.",
    "Finish with cheese: add 35g grated mozzarella cheese and stir until it fully melts into the sauce.",
    "Combine and serve: add the cooked pasta to the pan, toss to coat evenly in the sauce.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with extra herbs or chilli flakes if desired."
  ],
